  "note": "Bundled fallback so the FindHelp map is never empty when the live Supabase RPC is unreachable. 16 hand-curated CalFresh / California locations: 5 county welfare department offices (Los Angeles, San Francisco, Alameda, Santa Clara, Sacramento), 4 food banks, 2 community food pantries, and 5 EBT-retailer entries (supermarkets, ethnic grocers, and a farmers market). Coordinates are approximate; addresses are public-record best-effort; every entry is marked as seed data in notes so the user is warned to call ahead. Unlike Massachusetts, California operates a CalFresh Restaurant Meals Program (RMP) in participating counties — RMP-eligible restaurants are not yet represented in this seed file and should be sourced from the CDSS RMP retailer list before launch. When the live RPC is healthy these entries are unused.",
